examples.json holds the markdown input of every example in the test fixtures
of mistune 2.0.0a6, the files tests/fixtures/*.txt of its source package:
https://pypi.org/project/mistune/2.0.0a6/

Each key is "<fixture file name>-<n>" for the n-th example of that file. The
fixtures write a tab as "→"; examples.json has a tab instead. The expected
HTML of each example is left out. Nothing else is changed.


CommonMark examples

The examples named "commonmark-<n>" are example <n> of the CommonMark Spec,
version 0.28 (2017-08-01), by John MacFarlane:
https://spec.commonmark.org/0.28/

